feat!: improve Tailwind CSS support, TW3 requires @layer base; (#562)

## Overview
Improves Tailwind support but includes breaking change for TW3.

This will allow developers to use `bg-red-500` instead of prefixing with
`!bg-red-500`

## Type of Change
- [x] ✨ Enhancement (improves existing functionality)
- [x] 💥 Breaking change (requires migration)

## Implementation Details
In Tailwind 3 as they do not have CSS layers you need to wrap your
`@tailwind base` with this:

```css
@layer base, components;

@layer base {
  @tailwind base;
}
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
```

